  "title": "Vertiv Releases Application Brief for Broadcast and Government Production and Post-production at the Network Edge",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, today released an application brief for production and post-production broadcast and government environments, identifying typical challenges and the infrastructure that can address them. Vertiv experts will be at NAB Show, April 24-27, discussing IT management and infrastructure with attendees at their booth in the exhibit hall in the Las Vegas Convention Center.",
